  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tcell Mobile Network Expansion Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The loan will finance capital expenditures under the Borrower&amp;apos;s investment program to expand and upgrade the mobile network in Tajikistan. The company will procure and install new telecommunication equipment to increase the number of 4G sites by modernizing existing 2G and 3G sites and overall data transfer capacity.</narrative>
  </description>
